    "By accessing our website or making a reservation, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions and our Privacy Policy.": "访问我们的网站或进行预订，即表示您同意受这些条款与条件以及我们的隐私政策约束。",
    "Canal Suite": "运河套房",
    "Canal-Side Facial (60 min)": "运河边面部护理（60分钟）",
    "Canal-Side Seafood Platter ฿1,200": "运河边海鲜拼盘 ฿1,200",
