    "Cancellation policies vary by rate plan and room type. The specific policy applicable to your reservation will be clearly stated at the time of booking.": "取消政策因价格方案和房型而异。适用于您预订的具体政策将在预订时明确说明。",
    "Careers": "职业机会",
    "Celebrate your love story where timeless elegance meets enchanting riverside charm. Specializing in intimate to grand ceremonies and receptions on the historic Bangkok Noi Canal.": "在永恒优雅与迷人水岸风情交融之处，庆祝您的爱情故事。专注于在历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河举办从亲密到盛大的婚礼仪式和招待会。",
    "Certain treatments may be contraindicated for guests who are pregnant, have medical conditions, or are under the age of 18. Please disclose all relevant health information during the booking process.": "某些疗程可能不适合孕妇、有健康状况的宾客或18岁以下人士。请在预订过程中披露所有相关健康信息。",
    "Check-In Date *": "入住日期 *",
