    "Check-in from 2:00 PM · Check-out by 12:00 PM": "下午2:00起办理入住 · 中午12:00前退房",
    "Check-in time is 3:00 PM. Check-out time is 12:00 PM (noon). Late check-out is subject to availability and may incur an additional charge.": "入住时间为下午3:00。退房时间为中午12:00。延迟退房须视客房空档而定，可能须支付额外费用。",
    "Children's and family wellness options available": "提供儿童及家庭健康疗愈选项",
