    "Depart W1 → Arrive at Wat Takien: pay respects at the temple, enjoy local food, soak in the floating market atmosphere, and cruise back via the northern canal.": "从W1出发 → 抵达Wat Takien：在寺庙参拜，品尝当地美食，感受水上市场氛围，经北部运河游船返回。",
