    "Each morning before the world wakes, saffron-robed monks walk silently along the Bangkok Noi Canal to receive alms from the local community.": "每天清晨，在世界苏醒之前，身着橘黄色袈裟的僧侣们沿着曼谷诺伊运河静静地行走，从当地社区化缘。",
    "Each programme is curated around your unique goals by your personal Wellness Navigator — daily treatments, private yoga, botanical nourishment, and canal-based wellness experiences designed to create lasting change.": "每个计划由您的专属健康导航师根据您的独特目标量身定制——每日疗程、私人瑜伽、植物滋养和运河健康体验，旨在创造持久的改变。",
    "Each room comes with its own yoga mat, and guests are warmly welcome to practice at any time — in the privacy of their room, on their terrace, or anywhere in our open canal-side spaces.": "每间客房均配备专属瑜伽垫，诚挚欢迎宾客随时练习——在私密的房间内、阳台上，或我们开放的运河边任何空间。",
    "Each venue at W1 Bangkoknoi offers a distinct atmosphere for your perfect day — from the grandeur of the ballroom to the intimate charm of the canal's edge.": "W1 Bangkoknoi的每处场地都为您的完美日子提供独特的氛围——从宴会厅的宏伟气派到运河边的亲密魅力。",
