    "Every journey includes a dedicated Boat Butler who shares the history and stories of both canal banks, serves refreshments on board, and ensures your experience is as enriching as it is beautiful.": "每次旅程都配有专属游艇管家，为您讲述两岸的历史与故事，在船上提供茶点，确保您的体验既丰富又美好。",
    "Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom — from a cooling butterfly pea welcome tea to post-treatment botanical elixirs.": "每顿餐饮和饮品都彰显泰国植物与草本智慧——从清凉的蝶豆花迎宾茶到疗程后的植物精华饮品。",
    "Every meal and beverage celebrates Thai botanicals and herbal wisdom. Food at W1 is a joyful, vital connection to the land and the canal.": "每顿餐饮和饮品都彰显泰国植物与草本智慧。W1的美食是与土地和运河之间充满活力的愉悦连接。",
    "Every treatment at Palace Wellness is a journey — not simply a service.": "Palace Wellness的每次疗程都是一段旅程——而非仅仅是一项服务。",
