    "Nestled along the historic Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, our dedicated Wedding Concierge team transforms your dream wedding into a flawless reality.": "坐落于暖武里历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河畔，我们专属的婚礼礼宾团队将您梦想中的婚礼变成无可挑剔的现实。",
