    "Service staff on board": "船上服务人员",
    "Set on the historic Bangkok Noi canal, we are an urban wellness sanctuary grounded in reality — built not on claims of transcendence but on the careful, consistent delivery of deeply restorative experiences.": "坐落于历史悠久的曼谷诺伊运河边，我们是一处立足现实的都市健康圣地——不以超凡脱俗的宣言为基础，而以精心、持续地提供深度恢复性体验为根本。",
    "Seven signature light bite menus, beautifully crafted to complement your daytime relaxation. Each dish is thoughtfully prepared to nourish without weighing you down.": "七款精心打造的标志性轻食菜单，与您的白天放松相得益彰。每道菜都经过精心准备，滋养身体而不增加负担。",
    "Single-origin Thai arabica brewed by our in-house baristas, alongside curated Thai herbal teas and signature cold-pressed juices.": "由内部咖啡师冲泡的单一产地泰国阿拉比卡咖啡，搭配精选泰国草本茶和标志性冷压果汁。",
    "Smart casual dress code. Reservations recommended, particularly for dinner and weekends. All dietary requirements accommodated with advance notice.": "智能休闲着装要求。建议预订，尤其是晚餐和周末。提前通知可满足所有饮食要求。",
