    "Submit your enquiry below and our team will confirm availability and tailor your perfect canal-side escape. We respond within 2 hours during hotel hours.": "在下方提交您的查询，我们的团队将确认可用性并为您量身定制完美的运河边休闲体验。在酒店服务时间内，我们将在2小时内回复。",
