    "W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort shall not be liable for any loss, damage, or injury to guests or their property, except where such loss, damage, or injury results from the gross negligence or wilful misconduct of the resort.": "W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort对宾客或其财产的任何损失、损坏或伤害不承担责任，除非该损失、损坏或伤害源于度假村的重大过失或故意不当行为。",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi sits at the heart of one of Thailand's most storied waterways. We've curated a collection of complementary canal-side activities to help you connect with the life, culture, and beauty of the Bangkok Noi.": "W1@Bangkoknoi坐落于泰国最富传奇色彩的水道之心。我们精心策划了一系列互补的运河边活动，帮助您与曼谷诺伊的生活、文化和美丽相连接。",
    "Wake to views of the Bangkok Noi Canal from your Deluxe room. Available in King and Twin configurations, these spacious rooms feature warm Thai-inspired interiors.": "从豪华客房醒来，欣赏曼谷诺伊运河的景色。提供大床和双床两种配置，这些宽敞的客房以温馨的泰式风格室内装饰为特色。",
