    "Wat Ta-Nod · Wat Prang Luang · Wat Rat Prachong Tham": "塔诺德寺 · 普朗銮寺 · Wat Rat Prachong Tham",
    "We collect personal information that you provide directly to us when making reservations, submitting enquiries, booking treatments, or contacting us in any way.": "我们收集您在预订、提交查询、预约疗程或以任何方式联系我们时直接提供给我们的个人信息。",
    "We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties. We may share information with:": "我们不会向第三方出售、出租或交换您的个人信息。我们可能与以下方共享信息：",
    "We endeavour to ensure that the information on this website is accurate and up to date, but we make no warranties or representations as to its accuracy.": "我们努力确保本网站上的信息准确且最新，但我们不对其准确性作出任何保证或声明。",
    "We honour beautiful traditions with our three most popular ceremonial journeys, meticulously coordinated for an unforgettable experience.": "我们以三种最受欢迎的仪式之旅致敬美丽的传统，精心协调以创造难忘的体验。",
    "We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, disclosure, alteration, or destruction.": "我们采取适当的技术和组织措施，保护您的个人信息免受未经授权的访问、披露、更改或销毁。",
    "We may also collect information automatically when you visit our website, including IP address, browser type, and pages visited, through the use of cookies and similar technologies.": "当您访问我们的网站时，我们也可能通过cookies和类似技术自动收集信息，包括IP地址、浏览器类型和访问页面。",
    "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with a revised date. Your continued use of our website constitutes your acceptance of any updated policy.": "我们可能会不时更新本隐私政策。更改将以修订日期发布在本页面上。您继续使用我们的网站即表示您接受任何更新后的政策。",
    "We reserve the right to amend these Terms & Conditions at any time. Updated terms will be posted on this page and take effect immediately upon posting.": "我们保留随时修改这些条款与条件的权利。更新后的条款将发布在本页面上，发布后立即生效。",
    "We retain your personal information for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes outlined in this policy, or as required by applicable law.": "我们保留您的个人信息的时间以满足本政策所述目的所需的时间为准，或根据适用法律的要求保留。",
    "We use the information we collect to:": "我们使用收集的信息来：",
    "We're here to help you plan the perfect stay. Whether you have a question, a special request, or simply want to say hello — we'd love to hear from you.": "我们在这里帮助您规划完美的住宿。无论您有问题、特殊要求，还是只想打个招呼——我们都很乐意听取您的意见。",
    "Wedding Enquiry": "婚礼咨询",
    "Weddings at W1 Bangkoknoi — where timeless elegance meets enchanting riverside charm. Intimate ceremonies to grand receptions, all perfectly curated.": "W1 Bangkoknoi的婚礼——永恒优雅与迷人水岸风情交融之处。从亲密仪式到盛大招待会，一切都完美策划。",
    "Wellbeing is sustained through shared experience. W1 nurtures a warm, supportive environment — for the neighbourhood, the team, and every guest who walks through our doors.": "健康通过共同体验来维系。W1培育温暖、互助的环境——为社区、团队以及每一位踏进我们大门的宾客。",
    "Wellness & Spa Treatment": "健康与水疗疗程",
    "Wellness breaks and team-building activity coordination": "健康休息和团建活动协调",
    "Wellness here is not a foreign import. Through our certified therapists, guests experience traditional Thai modalities — from ancient compress therapies and herbal steam to restorative touch.": "这里的健康疗愈不是舶来品。通过我们认证的治疗师，宾客体验传统泰式疗法——从古老的热敷疗法和草本蒸汽到恢复性按摩。",
    "Wellness is not an offering at W1 — it is our identity. Every experience is thoughtfully designed to restore your body, calm your mind, and reconnect you with a deeper sense of self.": "健康在W1不是一项服务——而是我们的身份认同。每次体验都经过精心设计，以修复您的身体、平静您的心灵，并让您与更深层的自我重新连接。",
    "What happens next?Our reservations team will review your request and respond by email and WhatsApp to confirm availability, share rates and room details.": "接下来会发生什么？我们的预订团队将审核您的请求，并通过电子邮件和WhatsApp回复，确认供应情况，分享价格和房间详情。",
    "WhatsApp": "WhatsApp",
    "Whether dining on the candlelit terrace, in the air-conditioned main salon with teak and silk detailing, or in the exclusive private dining room — every setting at Thai Boran is a memory in the making.": "无论是在烛光露台用餐、在配有柚木和丝绸细节的空调主厅，还是在独家私人餐厅——Thai Boran的每个场景都是正在创造中的美好记忆。",
    "Whether you are planning a high-profile corporate gathering or an intimate private celebration, W1@Bangkoknoi offers an unmatched combination of natural beauty, impeccable service, and versatile event spaces.": "无论您是在策划高端企业聚会还是亲密的私人庆典，W1@Bangkoknoi都提供无与伦比的自然美景、无可挑剔的服务和多功能活动空间的完美组合。",
    "Whether you're gliding silently through the morning mist on a paddle board, cycling through the canalside community, or participating in a cooking class guided by our chef — every experience is designed to deepen your connection with this remarkable place.": "无论您是在桨板上静静地穿越晨雾，骑车穿越运河边社区，还是在我们厨师的指导下参加烹饪课——每次体验都旨在加深您与这个非凡地方的联系。",
    "Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time": "随时撤回对营销通信的同意",
    "Within 24 hours, your Navigator sends a personal reflection — your wellness notes, gentle rituals to carry the calm home, and an invitation to return.": "在24小时内，您的导航师会发送一份个人感悟——您的健康记录、带着宁静回家的温和仪式，以及再次归来的邀请。",
    "Yes — staying at the hotel": "是——住在酒店",
    "Your Message *": "您的留言 *",
    "Your enquiry has been received by our team. We will be in touch within 2 hours during hotel hours (8 AM – 10 PM Bangkok time).": "您的查询已被我们的团队接收。我们将在酒店服务时间内（曼谷时间上午8点至晚上10点）2小时内与您联系。",
    "Your own private plunge pool, under open skies": "您自己的私人冷泡池，在开放的天空下",
    "Your personal Wellness Navigator reaches out via LINE to learn your goals, preferences, and rhythm — so your stay is shaped before you even arrive.": "您的专属健康导航师通过LINE联系您，了解您的目标、偏好和节奏——让您的住宿在抵达之前就已成形。",
    "Your private sanctuary where ancient Thai healing wisdom meets refined contemporary care. Canal-side yoga, herbal steam, signature rituals, and restorative treatments — all within a setting of quiet luxury.": "您的私人圣地，古老泰式疗愈智慧与精致当代关怀在此相遇。运河边瑜伽、草本蒸汽、标志性仪式和恢复性疗程——一切都在静谧奢华的环境中。",
