    "\"True luxury is the gift of time — time to heal, time to breathe, time to become who you are meant to be.\"": "“真正的奢华，是时间的馈赠——疗愈的时间、呼吸的时间、成为真正自己的时间。”",
    "\"Where ancient wisdom meets modern mastery.\"": "“古老智慧与现代匠艺在此交汇。”",
    "\"Your Calm by the Canal\" is our signature W1 Ritual — the first expression of the retreat we are becoming. A curated two-night experience where your treatments, dining, and pace along the canal are shaped entirely around you, before you even arrive.": "“Your Calm by the Canal”（运河畔的宁静）是我们的标志性 W1 Ritual——我们正在成为的疗愈度假体验的首篇章。这是一段精心策划的两晚之旅，您的疗程、餐饮与运河畔的节奏，早在您抵达之前，便已完全围绕您而定制。",
