    "Direct booking advantage: Book directly with us for the best available rate, complimentary early check-in (subject to availability), and a welcome amenity upon arrival.": "直接预订优势：直接向我们预订，可享最优价格、免费提前入住（视空房情况而定）以及抵达时的迎宾礼遇。",
    "Discover authentic Thai traditions through cuisine, art, and local heritage.": "通过美食、艺术与在地传承，探索地道的泰国传统。",
