    "Family Reunions": "家庭团聚",
    "Fill in the form below and our team will respond within 2 hours during hotel hours (8 AM – 10 PM Bangkok time). For reservations, dining, or wellness bookings please use the dedicated links below.": "请填写下方表单，我们的团队将在酒店服务时间内（曼谷时间 8:00 – 22:00）2小时内回复。如需预订客房、餐饮或疗愈项目，请使用下方专属链接。",
    "Flagship Venue": "旗舰场地",
    "Flat-screen TV": "平板电视",
    "Flowing full-body massage with warm, botanically blended oils chosen for your goal — stress relief, calm, and more restful sleep. Jasmine, lemongrass, and kaffir lime melt tension while nourishing the skin.": "以温热的植萃复方精油进行的流畅全身按摩，依您的目标调配——舒缓压力、宁神静心、改善睡眠。茉莉、香茅与泰国青柠融化紧绷，同时滋养肌肤。",
    "Foot Massage — Reflexology": "足部按摩 — 反射疗法",
