    "For All Ages": "适合所有年龄",
    "For the ultimate elite experience, couples can opt for an exclusive resort buy-out, transforming our private canal villas into a secluded, romantic sanctuary for the wedding party and guests. The most intimate and exclusive offering W1 Bangkoknoi has to offer.": "追求极致尊享的新人可选择度假村整体包场，将我们的私人运河别墅化作专属婚礼宾客的隐世浪漫居所。这是 W1 Bangkoknoi 最私密、最尊贵的献礼。",
    "Four Exceptional Venues": "四大非凡场地",
    "Fragrant hom bananas dipped in a light coconut and sesame batter, fried until golden and crisp. Served warm with a sweet condensed milk drizzle — a beloved Thai classic, elevated with care.": "香甜的泰国香蕉裹上轻盈的椰香芝麻面糊，炸至金黄酥脆。趁热淋上香甜炼乳——一道深受喜爱的泰式经典，以匠心升华。",
    "Free Wi-Fi": "免费Wi-Fi",
