    "In-villa treatments available: Guests in our Wellness Villa, Canal Villa, or Pool Suite may request treatments in-villa. Please indicate in special requests.": "可提供别墅内疗程：入住疗愈别墅、运河别墅或泳池套房的宾客可预约别墅内疗程，请在特殊需求中注明。",
    "Incentive travel programmes featuring private boat excursions, Thai cooking classes, and Palace Wellness rejuvenation": "奖励旅游计划，含私人游船之旅、泰式烹饪课程与 Palace Wellness 焕活体验",
