    "Multi-step ritual with gentle enzyme exfoliation, Thai herbal infusion mask, gold-infused facial massage, and silk-protein hydration for luminous, glowing skin.": "多步骤焕肤仪式：温和酵素去角质、泰式草本浸萃面膜、黄金面部按摩与丝蛋白深层保湿，令肌肤晶莹透亮、光彩照人。",
