    "Overlooking the serene Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi, our signature restaurant and bar offer an intimate journey through Thai flavours. From royal palace recipes passed down through generations to innovative reinterpretations, every dish tells a story of Thailand's waterways, gardens, and vibrant culture.": "坐望暖武里静谧的曼谷诺依运河，我们的招牌餐厅与酒吧呈献一段亲密的泰式风味之旅。从世代相传的皇家宫廷食谱到创新演绎，每道菜肴都诉说着泰国水道、园林与鲜活文化的故事。",
