    "Soft, pillowy taro dumplings simmered in sweetened warm coconut milk, delicately scented with pandan leaf. A comforting Thai dessert of quiet elegance, rooted in the flavours of old Siam.": "软糯的芋头小圆子浸于香甜的温热椰奶之中，缀以班兰叶的清雅香气。一道静谧优雅、暖心怡人的泰式甜品，根植于古暹罗的风味。",
