    "Special occasions: Let us know if you're celebrating a birthday, anniversary, or other milestone — we love to create memorable moments.": "特别时刻：若您正在庆祝生日、纪念日或其他重要时刻，请告知我们——我们乐于为您创造难忘瞬间。",
    "Spiritual Blessing Tour: \"Sai Mu\"": "祈福之旅：“Sai Mu”",
    "Stand-Up Paddle Board": "站立式桨板",
    "Starters": "前菜",
    "Steamed muslin pouches filled with lemongrass, turmeric, ginger, and camphor — gently pressed along the body for warmth, muscle ease, and improved circulation. A deeply soothing ritual from our botanical garden.": "以蒸热的棉布药包——内含香茅、姜黄、生姜与樟脑——沿身体轻柔按压，带来温热舒适、放松肌肉、促进循环。一场源自我们植物花园的深度舒缓仪式。",
    "Submit your enquiry below and our team will confirm availability and tailor your perfect canal-side escape. We respond within 2 hours during hotel hours (8 AM – 10 PM, Bangkok time).": "请在下方提交您的咨询，我们的团队将确认可预订情况，并为您量身定制完美的运河畔假期。酒店服务时间内（曼谷时间 8:00 – 22:00），我们将在2小时内回复。",
    "Sun – Thu": "周日 – 周四",
    "Targeted release for neck, shoulder, and upper back tension accumulated from screens and desk work. Our therapists apply focused pressure and stretching techniques to ease modern urban strain.": "针对因久对屏幕与案头工作而积累的颈、肩、上背部紧张，进行精准释放。理疗师以聚焦按压与伸展技法，纾解现代都市生活的劳损。",
    "Terms": "条款",
    "Terrace & Lounge": "露台与酒廊",
    "Thai Blessing Ceremonies": "泰式祈福仪式",
    "Thai Boran Breakfast": "Thai Boran 早餐",
    "Thai Boran – meaning \"traditional Thai\" in its most refined form – celebrates Thailand's rich culinary heritage while embracing contemporary techniques and the finest local ingredients sourced from the bustling canal markets and nearby farms.": "Thai Boran——意为最精粹形式的“传统泰式”——礼赞泰国深厚的美食传承，同时融汇当代技艺，选用来自热闹运河市集与邻近农场的顶级本地食材。",
    "Thai Herbal Compress — Luk Pra Kob": "泰式草本热敷 — Luk Pra Kob",
    "Thai Massage for Health": "泰式健康按摩",
    "Thai massage, herbal compress rituals, and hydrotherapy to release tension and renew vitality.": "泰式按摩、草本热敷仪式与水疗，释放紧张、焕新活力。",
    "Thank You": "感谢您",
    "The Bangkok Noi Canal is glassy at dawn. Borrow a stand-up paddle board or kayak from the hotel jetty and explore the waterway at your own pace — past canal-side temples, local homes, and the lush mangrove banks that frame the resort.": "破晓时分的曼谷诺依运河水面如镜。从酒店码头借用站立式桨板或皮划艇，以自己的节奏探索水道——途经运河畔的寺庙、当地民居，以及环抱度假村的葱郁红树林岸线。",
    "The W1 Compass": "W1 Compass",
    "The canal is an active part of the healing, not just a view. We invite guests to slow down and align their breathing with the water, finding balance and tranquillity in this protected pocket of nature.": "运河是疗愈的有机部分，而非仅仅一道风景。我们邀请宾客放慢脚步，让呼吸与水流同频，在这片受庇护的自然天地中寻得平衡与安宁。",
    "The shaded canal terrace and air-conditioned lounge are also available for private hire for intimate gatherings of up to 20 guests.": "遮荫的运河露台与空调酒廊亦可供私人包场，适合最多20位宾客的私密聚会。",
    "Tiger prawns coated in a thick, fragrant dry red curry paste with kaffir lime leaves, coconut cream, and fresh red chilli. Rich yet balanced, this semi-dry curry is a refined expression of southern Thai culinary mastery.": "老虎虾裹以浓郁芳香的干式红咖喱酱，佐泰国青柠叶、椰浆与新鲜红辣椒。浓醇而平衡，这道半干咖喱是泰南烹饪造诣的精致呈现。",
    "Tom Kha Goong": "Tom Kha Goong（椰奶鲜虾汤）",
    "Traditional Thai monk blessing ceremony at dawn on the canal terrace": "破晓时分于运河露台举行的泰式传统僧侣祈福仪式",
    "Transform For Life": "焕变一生",
    "Transformative Balance": "蜕变之衡",
