    "Turmeric, ginger, black pepper, lime · anti-inflammatory and grounding · taken before breakfast": "姜黄、生姜、黑胡椒、青柠 · 抗炎安神 · 早餐前饮用",
    "Turmeric-Ginger Wellness Shot": "姜黄生姜活力小饮",
    "Unforgettable ceremonies on the Bangkok Noi Canal — intimate Thai traditions, grand ballroom receptions, and bespoke celebrations.": "曼谷诺依运河畔的难忘典礼——私密的泰式传统仪式、盛大的宴会厅婚宴与专属定制庆典。",
