    "W1 Bangkoknoi · Urban Wellness Retreat": "W1 Bangkoknoi · 都市疗愈度假村",
    "W1 Café invites you to immerse yourself in a captivating visual journey. Seated at the water's edge, our storytelling unfolds through breathtaking, timeless views of the historic Thai temple across the canal — a scene of rare beauty that shifts with the light, from the golden serenity of morning to the luminous glow of dusk. Whether you arrive by boat or by foot, linger over a perfectly brewed coffee or a handcrafted light bite, and let the temple view tell its ancient story.": "W1 Café 邀您沉浸于一场动人的视觉之旅。坐于水畔，故事在运河对岸历史悠久的泰式古寺的绝美永恒景致中徐徐展开——这幅罕见的美景随光线流转，从清晨的金色宁静到黄昏的璀璨光辉。无论乘船或步行而至，请在一杯完美冲煮的咖啡或一份手作轻食中流连，让寺庙景致为您讲述它古老的故事。",
    "Wake to views of the Bangkok Noi Canal from your Deluxe room. Available in King and Twin configurations, these generously appointed rooms blend contemporary comfort with authentic Thai design elements and canal-side serenity. Perfect for couples, friends, or families — an extra bed can be added on request.": "在豪华客房中醒来，曼谷诺依运河的景致映入眼帘。提供特大床与双床配置，宽敞雅致的客房将当代舒适与地道泰式设计元素及运河畔的宁静融为一体。适合情侣、好友或家庭——可应要求加床。",
    "Wat Takhian Floating Market Cruise": "Wat Takhian 水上市场游船之旅",
    "Watch Video": "观看视频",
    "We aim to keep information accurate and up to date, but we do not warrant that every detail on this site is complete or error-free. Links to third-party services (such as online booking engines or maps) are provided for convenience; their terms apply separately.": "我们力求信息准确且及时更新，但不保证本网站的每项细节均完整无误。指向第三方服务（如在线预订引擎或地图）的链接仅为方便而提供，其条款另行适用。",
    "We are carefully curating this experience. Further details will be announced in due course.": "我们正在精心打磨这一体验，更多详情将适时公布。",
    "We honour beautiful traditions with our three most popular ceremonial journeys, meticulously coordinated for an effortless celebration.": "我们以三大最受欢迎的仪式之旅致敬美好传统，精心统筹，让庆典轻松从容。",
    "We're here to help you plan the perfect stay. Whether you have a question, a special request, or simply want to learn more about life on the Bangkok Noi Canal — our team is ready.": "我们随时为您规划完美的入住体验。无论您有疑问、特别需求，或只是想进一步了解曼谷诺依运河畔的生活——我们的团队都已准备就绪。",
    "Weddings at W1 Bangkoknoi — where timeless elegance meets enchanting riverside charm. Intimate ceremonies to grand receptions for 50 to 200 guests.": "W1 Bangkoknoi 的婚礼——永恒优雅与迷人河畔风情在此交汇。从私密仪式到50至200位宾客的盛大婚宴。",
    "Welcome Elixirs": "迎宾焕活饮",
    "Welcome Ritual & Consultation": "迎宾仪式与咨询",
    "Wellbeing is sustained through shared experience. W1 nurtures a warm, supportive environment — for the neighbourhood as much as the traveller, built on empathy and shared flourishing along the canal.": "幸福源于共享的体验。W1 营造温暖互助的环境——既属于旅人，也属于街坊邻里，建立在同理心与运河畔共同繁盛的基础之上。",
    "Wellness Catering": "疗愈餐饮服务",
    "Wellness Cuisine": "疗愈美食",
    "Wellness Minibar": "疗愈迷你吧",
    "Wellness cuisine crafted from organic Thai ingredients to support your transformation.": "以泰国有机食材精心打造的疗愈美食，为您的蜕变之旅提供支持。",
    "Wellness here is not a foreign import. Through our certified therapists, guests experience traditional Thai modalities — herbal compress massage, reflexology, and Nuad Boran — adapted for modern urban tension, screen strain, and burnout.": "在这里，疗愈并非舶来品。通过我们的认证理疗师，宾客可体验传统泰式疗法——草本热敷按摩、足部反射疗法与 Nuad Boran——并针对现代都市紧张、屏幕劳损与身心倦怠加以调适。",
    "Wellness is not an offering at W1 — it is our identity. Every experience is thoughtfully designed to restore your body, rebalance your mind, and reawaken your spirit on the banks of the timeless Bangkok Noi Canal.": "在 W1，疗愈不是一项服务——而是我们的本质。每一次体验都经过用心设计，在亘古流淌的曼谷诺依运河畔，修复您的身体、重衡您的心灵、唤醒您的精神。",
    "Where Timeless Elegance": "当永恒优雅",
    "Whether you're gliding silently through the morning mist on a paddle board, cycling through the canalside community, or watching monks receive alms at dawn, every experience here connects you to a Thailand that most visitors never reach.": "无论是在晨雾中静静滑行于桨板之上、骑行穿越运河畔的社区，还是在破晓时分观看僧侣接受布施，这里的每一次体验，都将您与大多数游客无缘触及的泰国紧紧相连。",
    "Within 24 hours, your Navigator sends a personal reflection — your wellness notes, gentle rituals to carry the calm home, and a special returning guest offer.": "24小时内，您的健康领航师将送上一份专属回顾——您的疗愈笔记、可将宁静带回家中的温柔仪式，以及一份回访宾客专属礼遇。",
    "Year-round, covered outdoor spaces available": "全年可用，备有带顶户外空间",
    "Yoga & Movement": "瑜伽与律动",
    "Your Calm by the Canal สายน้ำสิริชีวา": "运河畔的宁静 Your Calm by the Canal สายน้ำสิริชีวา",
    "Your Calm by the Canal, deepened — daily treatments, private yoga, botanical meals, and guided canal meditation. Your Navigator shapes every detail around your rhythm.": "“运河畔的宁静”的深度延展——每日疗程、私人瑜伽、植萃餐食与引导式运河冥想。您的健康领航师围绕您的节奏雕琢每个细节。",
    "Your Wellness Journey Card": "您的疗愈旅程卡",
    "Your enquiry has been received. Our team will respond within 2 hours during hotel hours (8 AM – 10 PM Bangkok time). We look forward to welcoming you to the Bangkok Noi Canal.": "您的咨询已收到。我们的团队将在酒店服务时间内（曼谷时间 8:00 – 22:00）2小时内回复。期待在曼谷诺依运河畔迎接您的到来。",
    "Your personal Wellness Navigator reaches out via LINE to learn your goals, preferences, and rhythm — so your stay arrives already shaped around you.": "您的专属健康领航师将通过 LINE 与您联系，了解您的目标、偏好与节奏——让您的住宿在抵达前便已围绕您量身成型。",
    "Yum Woon Sen Boran — Classic Glass Noodle Salad": "Yum Woon Sen Boran — 经典凉拌粉丝",
