    "Nestled along the tranquil Bangkok Noi Canal in Nonthaburi—just a short private boat ride from Bangkok's vibrant heart—W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort stands as Thailand's newest icon of refined luxury.": "坐落于暖武里宁静的曼谷诺依运河畔——距离曼谷繁华市中心仅短途私人游船之遥——W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort 是泰国最新的精致奢华地标。",
