    "View": "景观",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort (\" W1@Bangkoknoi \") respects your privacy. This page outlines how we collect, use, and protect personal information submitted through our website, enquiry forms, and booking channels.": "W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort（\"W1@Bangkoknoi\"）尊重您的隐私。本页说明我们如何收集、使用并保护通过网站、询价表单及预订渠道提交的个人信息。",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi on Facebook": "W1@Bangkoknoi 的 Facebook",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi on Instagram": "W1@Bangkoknoi 的 Instagram",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi sits at the heart of one of Thailand's most storied waterways. We've curated a collection of complimentary and exclusive experiences that invite you to explore the canal, its temples, its people, and its rhythms — by boat, by board, and on foot.": "W1@Bangkoknoi 坐落于泰国最具传奇色彩的水道之一的中心。我们精心策划了一系列免费与专属体验，邀请您以游船、桨板和步行的方式探索运河、寺庙、居民与生活节奏。",
    "W1@Bangkoknoi": "W1@Bangkoknoi",
    "Website": "网站",
    "Whether dining on the candlelit terrace, in the air-conditioned main salon with teak and silk detailing, or in a private pavilion, Thai Boran delivers a sensory experience that perfectly complements the timeless luxury of W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort.": "无论是在烛光露台、以柚木与丝绸点缀的空调主厅，还是在私人亭阁用餐，Thai Boran 都能带来与 W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort 永恒奢华完美呼应的感官体验。",
    "Whether you are planning a high-profile corporate gathering or an intimate private celebration, W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort delivers exceptional service and unforgettable memories on the historic Bangkok Noi Canal.": "无论您筹划的是高端企业聚会还是私密庆祝活动，W1@Bangkoknoi Hotel & Wellness Resort 都能在历史悠久的曼谷诺依运河畔，提供卓越服务与难忘回忆。",
